graph TD
    %% User Input
    User["👤 User"]
    Profile["👤 User Profile<br/>Genre, Mood, Energy"]
    Context["📍 Context<br/>Time, Activity, Mood"]

    %% Input Processing
    User -->|Provides Preferences| Profile
    User -->|Current Situation| Context

    %% Main Agent
    Agent["🤖 Recommendation Agent<br/>Multi-Step Reasoning Engine"]
    Profile -->|Load| Agent
    Context -->|Analyze| Agent

    %% Agent Steps
    Planning["📋 PLANNING<br/>Understand Request"]
    Reasoning["🧠 REASONING<br/>Analyze Matches"]
    Scoring["📊 SCORING<br/>Evaluate Songs"]
    Ranking["🏆 RANKING<br/>Order Results"]
    Explaining["💬 EXPLAINING<br/>Generate Explanations"]

    Agent -->|Step 1| Planning
    Planning -->|Step 2| Reasoning
    Reasoning -->|Step 3| Scoring
    Scoring -->|Step 4| Ranking
    Ranking -->|Step 5| Explaining

    %% Core Components
    BaseScorer["🎵 Base Recommender<br/>Module 3 - Weighted Scoring<br/>Genre + Mood + Energy + ..."]
    Songs["🎶 Song Database<br/>18 Songs with Features"]

    Scoring -->|Uses| BaseScorer
    BaseScorer -->|Scores| Songs

    %% Output
    Recommendations["🎵 Recommendations<br/>Top 5 Songs"]
    ReasoningChain["📝 Reasoning Chain<br/>Step-by-step Explanation"]
    Confidence["📈 Confidence Scores<br/>0-100% per Song"]
    Trace["📊 Execution Trace<br/>Debug Info"]

    Explaining -->|Generate| Recommendations
    Explaining -->|Generate| ReasoningChain
    Explaining -->|Calculate| Confidence
    Explaining -->|Generate| Trace

    %% Evaluation System
    Evaluation["✅ Evaluation System"]
    Metrics["📊 Metrics<br/>Precision, Recall<br/>Diversity, NDCG"]
    BiasDetector["⚖️ Bias Detector<br/>Genre Bias<br/>Artist Bias<br/>Popularity Bias"]
    ReliabilityTester["🧪 Reliability Tests<br/>Edge Cases<br/>Robustness<br/>Consistency"]

    Recommendations -->|Evaluate| Evaluation
    Evaluation -->|Calculate| Metrics
    Evaluation -->|Analyze| BiasDetector
    Evaluation -->|Test| ReliabilityTester

    %% Output Display
    Output["📱 User Interface<br/>Recommendations + Explanations"]
    Recommendations -->|Display| Output
    ReasoningChain -->|Display| Output
    Confidence -->|Display| Output

    %% Styling
    classDef agent fill:#4CAF50,stroke:#2E7D32,color:#fff,stroke-width:3px
    classDef component fill:#2196F3,stroke:#1565C0,color:#fff,stroke-width:2px
    classDef data fill:#FF9800,stroke:#E65100,color:#fff,stroke-width:2px
    classDef evaluation fill:#9C27B0,stroke:#6A1B9A,color:#fff,stroke-width:2px
    classDef output fill:#F44336,stroke:#C62828,color:#fff,stroke-width:2px

    class Agent agent
    class Planning,Reasoning,Scoring,Ranking,Explaining component
    class BaseScorer,Songs data
    class Metrics,BiasDetector,ReliabilityTester,Evaluation evaluation
    class Output,Recommendations,ReasoningChain,Confidence,Trace output